  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: "Uranium-235. Enriched nuclear fuel \u2014 3,000 entropy per atom. The
      alpha particle released during enrichment is recovered by your Containment
      building automatically: 20 eV returned to the grid per particle."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: At scale, the decay particles emitted by your radioactive pipeline contribute
      meaningfully to your power budget. Alpha carries 20 eV. Beta carries 10. Let
      the decay work for you.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
